    "description": "Welcome to Park 314, a stunning 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom residence offering a rare and coveted feature: an exclusive-use patio overlooking a serene courtyard. This is one of only nine units at One Mission Bay to boast such a desirable amenity. This thoughtfully upgraded home showcases elegant new hardwood floors throughout and a galley-style open kitchen equipped with premium built-in Gaggenau appliances, including a five-burner gas cooktop, oven, refrigerator, and dishwasher. With beautifully integrated wood paneling and abundant cabinet and counter space, the kitchen is as functional as it is stylish. A dedicated parking space adds convenience to this chic urban retreat. Residents of One Mission Bay enjoy an unparalleled array of amenities: 24-hour lobby staff, an outdoor heated pool, hot tub, resident dining and lounge areas, a sprawling terrace with a fire pit, cabanas, barbecues, and outdoor dining options. Additional highlights include a state-of-the-art fitness center, a business center with private meeting rooms, a library, and a reservable guest suite for visitors. Welcome home to vibrant Mission Bay, surrounded by abundant greenery, and endless activities, it's the perfect place to enjoy urban convenience and outdoor serenity."
  },
